<title>ITALY: Italy's IRI shareholder meeting set for June 16.</title>
<headline>Italy's IRI shareholder meeting set for June 16.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian state industrial holding IRI will hold its shareholder meeting on June 16, the Italian Treasury said in a statement Thursday.</p>
<p>The meeting of Istituto per la Ricostruzione Industriale SpA shareholders had been set provisionally for Friday June 13.</p>
<p>((--Rome bureau +3966782501))</p>
